@startuml layout-calculation-sequence
!theme plain
title DALi UI - Layout Calculation Process (Measure & Arrange)

' Public API: only Layout has AddView/Contents; Measure/Arrange are invoked by the layout system.
' This sequence shows the internal flow (ViewImpl, LayoutManager).

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Application\n(Window)" as App
participant "Adaptor\n(DALi Core)" as Adaptor
participant "LayoutControllerImpl" as LC
participant "ViewImpl\n(layout root)" as Root
participant "LayoutManager" as LM
participant "ViewImpl\n(child)" as Child

== Per-frame: Process layout roots ==
App -> App : InvalidateMeasure() or\nRegisterWithLayoutController()
note right: Layout roots are registered\nwhen they need a layout pass.

Adaptor -> LC : Process(postProcess=false)\n(called once per frame)
activate LC

LC -> LC : ProcessLayouts()
note right: Iterate over mPendingViews\n(layout roots for this window)

loop for each layout root
  LC -> Root : ProcessLayoutRoot(view)
  activate Root

  == Resolve constraints ==
  LC -> Root : GetLayoutWidth()\nGetLayoutHeight()
  Root --> LC : layoutWidth, layoutHeight
  LC -> LC : Resolve constraints\n(window size or parent Actor size;\nfixed spec overrides)

  == Measure pass ==
  LC -> Root : Measure(widthConstraint, heightConstraint)
  activate Root #LightBlue

  alt view is collapsed
    Root --> LC : MeasuredSize(0, 0)
  else cache hit (same constraints)
    Root --> LC : mMeasuredSize (cached)
  else measure
    Root -> Root : Subtract margin from constraints
    Root -> Root : OnMeasure(innerW, innerH)
    activate Root #LightGreen

    alt has LayoutManager
      Root -> LM : Measure(this, widthConstraint, heightConstraint)
      activate LM
      LM -> LM : GetChildren(view)
      loop for each child
        LM -> Child : MeasureChild(child, childW, childH)
        activate Child
        Child -> Child : Measure() [recursive]
        Child --> LM : MeasuredSize
        deactivate Child
      end
      LM --> Root : content MeasuredSize
      deactivate LM
      Root -> Root : Add padding; apply MatchParent if needed
    else no LayoutManager
      Root -> Root : Compute size from spec\n(fixed / MatchParent / natural size)
    end
    Root -> Root : ApplyConstraints(measured)\nStore mMeasuredSize, update cache
    deactivate Root
    Root --> LC : mMeasuredSize
    deactivate Root
  end
  deactivate Root

  == Arrange pass ==
  LC -> LC : Build LayoutRect(0, 0, measuredSize)
  LC -> Root : Arrange(bounds)
  activate Root

  Root -> Root : OnArrange(bounds)
  activate Root #LightYellow
  Root -> Root : Apply alignment, margin;\nset Actor position/size/visibility

  alt has LayoutManager
    Root -> Root : Compute contentBounds\n(inside padding)
    Root -> LM : ArrangeChildren(this, contentBounds)
    activate LM
    loop for each child
      LM -> LM : Compute child bounds\n(per layout algorithm)
      LM -> Child : ArrangeChild(child, childBounds)
      activate Child
      Child -> Child : Arrange() [recursive]
      Child --> LM : arranged size
      deactivate Child
    end
    LM --> Root : arranged size
    deactivate LM
  end
  deactivate Root
  Root --> LC : arranged size
  deactivate Root

end
deactivate LC
Adaptor <-- LC : return

== Invalidation flow (when layout must be recomputed) ==
note over Root, Child
  When a view's size/layout properties change:
  1) ViewImpl::InvalidateMeasure() or InvalidateArrange()
  2) Propagate to parent layout (GetParentLayout().InvalidateMeasure())
  3) At layout root: RegisterWithLayoutController()
  4) LayoutControllerImpl::RequestLayout(ViewImpl*) adds root to mPendingViews
  5) Next frame: Adaptor calls Process() -> ProcessLayouts() as above
end note

@enduml
